under GW/, the Python checkers and analysis programs under bgw/ and scripts/,
the tests under tests/, and the documentation under docs/ and .agent/.

It does NOT cover material derived from BerkeleyGW 4.0, which remains under
BerkeleyGW's own copyright and license. THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md records exactly
